      "text": "THE GHOSTS OF 1941 ARE BACK. 🇯🇵🚫\n\nWhile the world was looking away, Japan just SHATTERED 80 years of peace. PM Takaichi has officially killed the \"Peace Constitution\" without asking a single citizen.\n\nThey aren't just defending anymore—they’re DEALING. Japan is now an international ARMS DEALER, flooding 17 countries with lethal warships and tanks.\n\nWhat they aren't telling you:\n⚠️ Japan is building a \"Web of War\" across Asia.\n⚠️ Your tax dollars/security are being traded for \"Strategic Alliances.\"\n⚠️ The \"Type 25\" missile isn't for defense—it’s a reach-out-and-touch-someone weapon.\n\nFrom the UK to the Philippines, Japan is arming the world and poking the bear in the East Sea. Is this \"deterrence\" or are we being dragged into World War III?\n\nThe peaceful Japan we knew is DEAD. 🕊️💀\n\n#WWIII #Japan  #Militarism",
